    "priceSource": "fallback",
    "idsName": "261624",
    "idsInfo": "65895",
    "info": "FERTILIZERS\nFertilizers increase crop yields and enable plants to grow in planetary environments that lack the necessary nutrients due either to natural conditions or as a result of large-scale harvesting and grazing. Fertilizers are also a key component of the terraforming process, acting as a catalyst to accelerate the production of the self-sustaining plant ecologies that regulate climate and provide food for more advanced lifeforms.",
