    "price": 500,
    "itemIcon": "",
    "combinable": false,
    "priceSource": "fallback",
    "idsName": "261631",
    "idsInfo": "65911",
    "info": "OPTICAL CHIPS\nThe Optical Chip is a tiny electronic component featuring a general-purpose array of optical switches that can be programmed and instantly reprogrammed to perform nearly any function. Rather than using electricity, however, beams of light transfer information almost instantly, making general-purpose stateless computing machines possible. Optical Chips are the core components in the new field of Optronics on which all advanced technology is based.",
    "hitPts": 250,
